(7786808, 1289908, 36065, '<td valign="top">
<b>Hey there from the Critique Club</b>
<br/>
<br/><b>My thoughts on the image:</b> I tend to agree with ThingFish on this one.  While I get the thought that you were going for, I just don''t think that it hit the challenge very well.
<br/>
<br/><b>My ideas for improvement: </b> I think it would have been very difficult to squeeze this one into the confines of the challenge, so I really wouldn''t have much to offer on improvement.  I do enjoy old cemetery and gravesite photos, as I currently have one doing ''meh'' in a challenge in voting now.  Grave shots are always hit or miss with me on this site.
<br/>
<br/><b>Where I would have/did score this entry:</b> I think this would have pulled a 3 or 4 from me.  The image is still nice, but it just didn''t fall into the challenge the way I would have interpreted it.  Even still, thanks for posting it.
<br/>
<br/>Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
<br/><b>Eric</b>
<br/></td>', 'Hey there from the Critique Club

My thoughts on the image: I tend to agree with ThingFish on this one.  While I get the thought that you were going for, I just don''t think that it hit the challenge very well.

My ideas for improvement:  I think it would have been very difficult to squeeze this one into the confines of the challenge, so I really wouldn''t have much to offer on improvement.  I do enjoy old cemetery and gravesite photos, as I currently have one doing ''meh'' in a challenge in voting now.  Grave shots are always hit or miss with me on this site.

Where I would have/did score this entry: I think this would have pulled a 3 or 4 from me.  The image is still nice, but it just didn''t fall into the challenge the way I would have interpreted it.  Even still, thanks for posting it.

Thank you for the opportunity to provide a critique on your entry,
Eric', '2025-08-11 12:14:15.000000', NULL, 0);
